#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parse the six-bit results into the two syndromes ($s_Z$, $s_X$) and the four data bits, then apply each post-selection filter independently.\n"
msgstr "Parse hasil enam-bit menjadi dua syndrome ($s_Z$, $s_X$) dan empat bit data, lalu terapkan setiap filter post-selection secara independen.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
